<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/election-candidate/2026-general--timothy-rueckert">Timothy Rueckert</a> (Republican): Campaigns on flood mitigation and intergovernmental coordination, saying he would work with local, state, and federal governments to protect residents and water quality. He points to flood-control work during his time as…</li>
</ul>
